    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "section1_title",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 30,
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. GEOMETRÍA (meshes reales, a escala)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "section1"
      ],
      "seed": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "params_table",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 350,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "PARÁMETROS GEOMÉTRICOS:\n• wheel_radius (r) = 0.0381 m\n• wheel_separation EFECTIVA (W) = 0.1679 m  ← calibrada\n• vía de contacto (Wc) = 0.17635 m\n• wheel_base (L) = 0.13564 m\n• huella real = 0.217 × 0.222 m,  radio 0.158 m\n\nMASAS:\n• base_link = 5.0 kg   • wheels (4×) = 0.1 kg\n• lidar = 0.125 kg     • TOTAL = 5.525 kg\n\nLÍMITES (iguales en DWB, smoother y plugin):\n• v_max = 0.26 m/s     • ω_max = 1.0 rad/s\n• a_max = 1.0 m/s²     • α_max = 3.2 rad/s²",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "section1"
      ],
      "seed": 21
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "section2_bg",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 500,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
