      ],
      "seed": 22
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "section2_title",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 30,
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "2. CINEMÁTICA DIFFERENTIAL DRIVE",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "section2"
      ],
      "seed": 23
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "kinematics_forward",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 175,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 200,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "CINEMÁTICA DIRECTA:\nEntrada: (ω_L, ω_R) velocidades ruedas izq/der\n\nv = r(ω_R + ω_L) / 2\n\nω = r(ω_R - ω_L) / W\n\nDonde r = 0.0381 m,  W = 0.1679 m",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "section2"
      ],
      "seed": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "kinematics_inverse",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 310,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 275,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "CINEMÁTICA INVERSA:\nEntrada: (v, ω) velocidad del robot\n\nω_L = (v - ω·W/2) / r\n\nω_R = (v + ω·W/2) / r\n\n⚠ W NO es una distancia medible: es la vía\nEFECTIVA. Un skid-steer arrastra las ruedas\nal girar. Con la vía geométrica el robot giraba\nel 65% de lo comandado. Ver cinematica.md §6.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "section2"
      ],
      "seed": 25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "odometry",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 445,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 275,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "ODOMETRÍA:\n\nẋ = v·cos(θ)\nẏ = v·sin(θ)\nθ̇ = ω\n\nPlugin: gz-sim-diff-drive-system (Fortress)\n- Frecuencia: 50 Hz\n- Publica: /odom  (TF vía nodo odom_to_tf)\n- Entrada: /cmd_vel (Twist)\n- Integra la posición REAL de las juntas",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "section2"
      ],
      "seed": 26
    },
