    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "specs_dynamics",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 705,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 350,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "DINÁMICA:\n\nFricción anisótropa:\nfdir1 = eje de la rueda\nμ  = 0.05  (lateral)\nμ₂ = 1.0   (rodadura)\n\nmax_wheel_torque y\nmax_wheel_acceleration son\ntags de Gazebo Classic: el\nplugin NO los lee.\n\nFrecuencias:\nOdom: 50 Hz   Nav2: 20 Hz",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "section4"
      ],
      "seed": 34
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "specs_inertias",
      "x": 810,
      "y": 705,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 275,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "INERCIAS (kg·m²):\n\nbase_link:\nIxx=0.1135\nIyy=0.426\nIzz=0.5205\n\nwheel (cada una):\nIxx=0.0029\nIyy=0.0029\nIzz=0.0056",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
